OL,3,AEight children among 21 killed after
OL,4,Awar-damaged Gaza building collapses,
OL,5,Arescuers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FUN agencies and an Egyptian team have
OL,8,Fjoined the search for survivors, but
OL,9,Fofficials say it is proceeding slowly
OL,10,Fdue to a lack of equipment.
OL,12,FIn the initial rescue effort, members
OL,13,Fof the Hamas-run Civil Defence agency
OL,14,Fresorted to using their bare hands.
